Mutant M3: one last-level-cache miss per command.

After the command counter, one volatile read from a 64 MiB table at a
pseudo-random word (a per-thread LCG step, a few instructions). The table is
written when created so its pages are backed.

Must turn red: S.cyc. Must stay green: C.instr_u.

